{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Adding-a-GeoJSON-file-to-the-map","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Adding a GeoJSON file to the map"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre iOS offers several ways to work with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"http:\/\/geojson.org\/"},{"type":"text","text":" files."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON is a standard file format for representing geographic data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can host a GeoJSON file or bundle it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your application, you can use a GeoJSON file as the basis of an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object. Pass the file’s URL into the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer and add the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shape source to the map using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},{"type":"text","text":" method. The URL may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be a local file URL, an HTTP URL, or an HTTPS URL."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you’ve added the GeoJSON file to the map via an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can configure the appearance of its data and control what data is visible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. You can also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"#Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Converting-GeoJSON-data-into-shape-objects","text":"Converting GeoJSON data into shape objects","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have GeoJSON data in the form of source code (also known as “GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text”), you can convert it into an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object that the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" class understands"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively. First, create an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSData"},{"type":"text","text":" object out of the source code string or file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contents, then pass that data object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/shapeWithData:encoding:error:"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Finally, you can pass the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting shape or feature object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer and add it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the map, or you can use the object and its properties to power non-map-related"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functionality in your application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To include multiple shapes in the source, create and pass an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:"},{"type":"text","text":". Alternatively, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" method to create a shape source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with an array. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances, such as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" objects, whose attributes you can use when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applying a predicate to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or configuring a style layer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map","text":"Extracting GeoJSON data from the map","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object has an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/geoJSONDataUsingEncoding:"},{"type":"text","text":" method that you can use to create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON source code representation of the object. You can extract a feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object from the map using a method such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"About-GeoJSON-deserialization","text":"About GeoJSON deserialization","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The process of converting GeoJSON text into "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" objects is known as “GeoJSON deserialization”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON geometries, features, and feature collections are known in this SDK as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shapes, features, and shape collection features, respectively."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each GeoJSON object type corresponds to a type provided by either this SDK or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Core Location framework:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON object type"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SDK type"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (longitude, latitude)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (latitude, longitude)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Point","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MultiPoint","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollection","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"LineString","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MultiLineString","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolyline","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Polygon","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MultiPolygon","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"GeometryCollection","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Feature","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"FeatureCollection","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","type":"reference"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Feature"},{"type":"text","text":" object in GeoJSON corresponds to an instance of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subclass conforming to the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. There is a distinct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":"-conforming class for each type of geometry that a GeoJSON feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can contain. This allows features to be used as raw shapes where convenient. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, some features can be added to a map view as annotations. Note that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"identifiers and attributes will not be available for feature querying when a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature is used as an annotation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In contrast to the GeoJSON standard, it is possible for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" subclasses"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other than ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" to straddle the antimeridian."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following GeoJSON data types correspond straightforwardly to Foundation data"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types when they occur as feature identifiers or property values:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GeoJSON data type","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Objective-C representation"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift representation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNull","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNull","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNumber.boolValue","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Bool","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integer","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNumber.unsignedLongLongValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSNumber.longLongValue","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"UInt64","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int64","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Floating-point number","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSNumber.doubleValue","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSString","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample"],"title":"Styling and Dynamic Data"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson"]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFeature":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfeature","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNFeature","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNFeature"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  protocol is used to provide details about geographic features"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contained in an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference"},{"text":" object. Each concrete","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subclass of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" in turn has a subclass that conforms to this protocol. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature object associates a shape with an optional identifier and attributes."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNStyle"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNStyle","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSource","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AnimatedLineExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/animatedlineexample","role":"article","title":"Animated Line","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Add an animated line to a map","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addSource:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"addSource:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a new source to the current style."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNLineStyleLayer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnlinestylelayer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNLineStyleLayer"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNLineStyleLayer","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a style layer that renders one or more stroked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polylines on the map."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"